<title>USA: Humana names Gregory Wolf president.</title>
<headline>Humana names Gregory Wolf president.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Humana Inc said on Thursday that its board of directors had named Gregory Wolf as president of the company and David Jones as its vice chairman.</p>
</text>
